    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113577" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειράς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείρ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chap, crack,</i> prop. in the
			hands, but also in the feet, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειράδες
				χειρῶν, ποδῶν,</span>
			<i>chapped</i> hands or feet, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				1.81
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιράς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				194.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>heap of stones,</i> etc., <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
